### Data Centre Query Parameters
All data centre endpoints support the following query parameters:
- `from` - Start date for analysis (YYYY-MM-DD format)
- `to` - End date for analysis (YYYY-MM-DD format)
- `companyType` - Filter by company type (Supplier, Main Contractor, Consultant)
- `format` - Export format (csv, json, xlsx) for export endpoints
- `type` - Analytics type (ncr, performance, risk, company) for export endpoints

