### Conversation System Features
- **Entity-based conversations**: Link conversations to any entity type (initiatives, projects, NCRs, etc.)
- **Message threading**: Support for reply hierarchies with parent_message_id
- **Message editing**: Users can edit their own messages with edit tracking
- **Soft deletion**: Messages and conversations are soft deleted, preserving history
- **Participant tracking**: Automatic participant tracking based on message participation
- **Permission system**: Only creators can edit/delete conversations, only message authors can edit/delete their messages

